msgid "%d Data Sources have an RRDfile path outside the RRA directory. This version only creates and updates RRDfiles inside the RRA directory or a directory listed in $config['rrd_additional_paths'] in include/config.php, so these Data Sources will stop updating until one of the following is done:"
